    <briefdescription>
<para>Unique identifier for a resource species. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class encapsulates a value of type id_type used to distinguish resource species from each other. It provides access to the identifier value, support for hashing, and serialization capabilities. </para>
